at is your major?", "order": "k", "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c100025ab7d7f5aed0046", "descriptor": "Text"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd98db75930007", "body": "What degree are you currently pursuing?", "order": "j", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "96e5fd7602711000b93d387037ce0000", "answerText": "Associates", "order": "a"}, {"id": "96e5fd7602711000b93d39a37ad00000", "answerText": "Bachelors", "order": "b", "score": 100}, {"id": "96e5fd7602711000b93d3a3d2e420000", "answerText": "Masters", "order": "c", "score": 50}, {"id": "96e5fd7602711000b93d3ad6bb970000", "answerText": "PhD", "order": "d"}, {"id": "96e5fd7602711000b93d3b706a950000", "answerText": "Juris Doctor (J.D.)", "order": "e"}, {"id": "96e5fd7602711000b93d3ca396480000", "answerText": "Not currently pursuing a degree", "order": "f"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd98db75930004", "body": "Do you agree that GE Appliances may send you text messages solely for the purpose of communicating details of  jobs you may be interested in or have applied for? Message and data rates may apply.", "order": "i", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "fe49841087a50135aa90ccfb0702af1f", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a", "score": 100}, {"id": "fe49841087a501d109a7ccfb0702b01f", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd98db75930001", "body": "<p>I consent and acknowledge that as part of the GE Appliances recruitment process, GE Appliances may contact me regarding my application, the progress of my application, and my involvement in the recruitment process, including, but not limited to, surveys after the process.</p>", "order": "h", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "a7ba8f4cb4621001f55e86c50c7f0000", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a", "score": 100}, {"id": "a7ba8f4cb4621001f55e875f59820000", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd9841ce040005", "body": "Are you subject to a non-compete or have an employment agreement with another employer that would prevent you from being employed by GE Appliances or GE Appliances Affiliates?", "order": "g", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "fe49841087a501e194f6454309023a21", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a"}, {"id": "fe49841087a50189a20d464309023b21", "answerText": "No", "order": "b", "score": 100}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd9841ce040002", "body": "Have you ever been employed as a regular employee (including co-op/interns) or via a Staffing Agency by GE Appliances or any GE Appliances Affiliates?", "order": "f", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "fe49841087a501841d93454309023621", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a"}, {"id": "fe49841087a5015471a7454309023721", "answerText": "No", "order": "b", "score": 100}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd97a82c390006", "body": "Are you willing to undergo a background check and drug screen as a condition of employment?", "order": "e", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "fe49841087a501d56f3b454309023221", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a", "score": 100}, {"id": "fe49841087a50154c750454309023321", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd97a82c390003", "body": "<p>Will you in the future require sponsorship for employment visa status (e.g. H-1B, F-1, OPT, CPT visa status)?</p>", "order": "d", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "211bbc4007a61000b7752e815cac0000", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a"}, {"id": "211bbc4007a61000b7752e815cac0001", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd97a82c390000", "body": "<p>Do you now require sponsorship for employment visa status (e.g. H-1B visa status)?</p>", "order": "c", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "211bbc4007a61000b77196b6c3080001", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a"}, {"id": "211bbc4007a61000b77197518a980000", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "486e7eae2ec010010fbd970e9f570000", "body": "Are you 18 years of age or older?", "order": "b", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "fe49841087a501c4c8c7434309022621", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a", "score": 100}, {"id": "fe49841087a501e024dc434309022721", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}]}}
{"questionnaireId": "654041922e021001a5f997a55aef0000", "fetchedAt": "2026-09-24T12:36:20.383454+00:00", "payload": {"id": "654041922e021001a5f997a55aef0000", "questions": [{"id": "654041922e021001a662ba03cd6b0000", "body": "<p><u><b>Time in Role Guideline</b></u></p><p>To support employee development, ensure business continuity, and minimize disruptions, employees are expected to remain in their roles for a minimum of 18 months. Exceptions to this timeline may be approved by the direct manager in consultation with the HR Manager.</p><p></p><p>I acknowledge and understand the above guideline.</p>", "order": "a", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "654041922e021001a662b969ddb30000", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a"}, {"id": "654041922e021001a662b969ddb30001", "answerText": "No", "order": "b"}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "654041922e021001a5f998d8df170001", "body": "Is your current manager and/or your HR manager aware and supportive of you being considered for this role? (Your current manager and HR manager may be contacted at any point during this process.)", "order": "c", "possibleAnswers": [{"id": "245b5707c689019da836dc714a47e560", "answerText": "Yes", "order": "a", "score": 100}, {"id": "245b5707c68901ef453cdc714a47e660", "answerText": "No", "order": "b", "score": -100}], "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c10002583f04b9fc30042", "descriptor": "Multiple Choice - Single Select"}}, {"id": "654041922e021001a5f998d8df170000", "body": "How many years of relevant experience do you have in relation to the position that you are applying?", "order": "b", "required": true, "type": {"id": "c4d9bd57996c100025ab7d7f5aed0046", "descriptor": "Text"}}]}}
